        'Attendance and review manipulation — falsifying Mentor or Mentee No-Show claims, manipulating Session attendance or technical records, and creating, purchasing, selling, or otherwise manipulating Reviews and ratings.',
        'Harassment and safety violations — harassment, bullying, stalking, intimidation, threats, unlawful discrimination, sexual harassment or exploitation, coercion, and exploitation of another User’s trust or vulnerability.',
        'Impersonation and misrepresentation — impersonating another User, Creator, public figure, or Connectiqo representative, and materially misrepresenting identity, age, qualifications, professional status, or Services.',
        'Security and technical abuse — unauthorized Account access, compromising Platform security, reverse engineering or scraping the Platform without authorization, unauthorized automation (bots, scripts, crawlers), distributing malware, and phishing or other credential-theft conduct.',
        'Content and intellectual-property violations — commercial spam, unauthorized data collection, infringement of copyright, trademark, or other legally protected rights, and unauthorized recording, distribution, or commercial exploitation of Sessions or recordings.',
