        'Interference with Platform operations and processes — deliberately interfering with Platform availability, generating excessive or abusive technical traffic, submitting false support requests or fraudulent dispute claims, and coordinating with other Users (collusion) to manipulate Bookings, payments, Reviews, or Creator Earnings.',
